$MDESC::Type = "Ski Maps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Ski Course" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Olathe" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Perfect" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> With fast turns and unique loops, Skiway allows players to ski laps in a large course. Throughout the course, there are a number of boosts that are designed to adapt to the three basic armors. Also, checkpoints at various points of the track read out a player’s instantaneous speed. Because the course may be difficult to complete at first, skiers should utilize good health, speed, and body control.  "@
				
	"\n\n<f1>Date Created:<f2> April 2007" @			
	"\n\n<f1>Designed By:<f2> RedTower";

	